last_updated:           2026-09-02
source_event:           replxx/0.0.4 R02 L0d 返工 (PR 7625 官方 CI: test() method has no self.run() call — likely a stub; 本地 conan-verify/test_package/W3 prdiff 均通过; 修复 test() 加 self.run -> conan-verify G1-G4 PASS, test_replxx 9 断言 ALL PASS)
draft:                  true
contributor_id:         14
authors:                pc3-14
